      "domain": "avionics_realtime",
      "title": "avionics realtime method",
      "summary": "An avionics admission test for preemptive uniprocessor EDF used the processor demand bound. For each task i, its demand in an interval t was dbf_i(t)=max(0, floor((t-D_i)/T_i)+1)*C_i. The task set was feasible only if the sum of these demands was at most t at every relevant absolute-deadline candidate; one violating interval was a certificate of infeasibility.",
